    <string name="no_games">No games yet.\n\nPress "Browse Files" and look through your storage\n(USB stick, internal storage): open a games folder and press\n"Use this folder", open a game and pick "Play now",\nor tap a .rar/.zip and pick "Extract &amp; add games"\n(it unpacks itself and joins your library).\nYour games stay where they are — nothing is copied.\nYou must own the games you play.</string>
